    "custom_liquid_pGbMU8": {
      "type": "custom-liquid",
      "disabled": true,
      "name": "kategorien neu",
      "settings": {
        "custom_liquid": "{%- comment -%}\n============================================================\nWAS BRAUCHST DU FÜRS TRAINING? – Kategorie-Kacheln\nFassung 5, Stand 2026-08-25\n\nNEU in Fassung 5:\n  Kategorienamen in Versalien (text-transform: uppercase),\n  wie im Entwurf von Design. Bewusst per CSS und nicht als\n  ausgeschriebene Großbuchstaben im Text — sonst liest ein\n  Screenreader „W-E-S-T-E-N\" buchstabiert vor, und Google\n  bekommt den Namen in einer Schreibweise, die nirgends\n  sonst vorkommt.\n\nERSETZT zwei bestehende Abschnitte:\n  - „Was brauchst Du fürs Training?\" (multicolumn)\n  - Kategorie-Kacheln (collection_list)\nBeide danach ausblenden.\n\nNEU in Fassung 3:\n  - Texte von Patricia überarbeitet\n  - „Zubehör\" ersetzt durch „Spielzeug\"\n  - „Geschirre\" heißt jetzt „Training & Hund\" (wie im Menü)\n  - Bilder über images[...] | image_url | image_tag statt\n    file_url mit handgebautem srcset — das ist die von\n    Shopify empfohlene Methode: automatisches srcset,\n    width/height gegen Layout-Sprünge, WebP/AVIF vom CDN\n  - Erste Reihe lädt eager, damit sie nicht als LCP-Bild\n    verzögert wird\n\nBILDER (Einstellungen > Dateien, exakt diese Namen):\n  kachel-westen.jpg\n  kachel-jacken-ohne-orange.jpg\n  kachel-hoodies.jpg\n  kachel-geschirre.jpg\n  kachel-futter.jpg\n  kachel-spielzeug.jpg\n\nKARTEN: Weisser Kartenhintergrund mit Rahmen auf dem\n        Off-White des Abschnitts (Schema 2).\n\nSCHUTZ: Fehlt eine Datei, bleibt die Kachel grau statt\n        einen Liquid-Fehler auf der Seite anzuzeigen.\n============================================================\n{%- endcomment -%}\n\n<style>\n  .iq-kach__h{margin:0 0 20px;}\n  .iq-kach__grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr);gap:10px;}\n  .iq-kach__item{display:block;text-decoration:none;background:#FFFFFF;border:1px solid #DCDBD7;\n                 color:#171717;transition:border-color .15s ease;}\n  .iq-kach__item:hover{border-color:#A51D1B;}\n  .iq-kach__frame{overflow:hidden;aspect-ratio:1/1;background:#E4E3DF;}\n  .iq-kach__img{display:block;width:100%;height:100%;object-fit:cover;transition:transform .35s ease;}\n  .iq-kach__item:hover .iq-kach__img{transform:scale(1.03);}\n  .iq-kach__body{padding:14px 14px 16px;}\n  .iq-kach__label{margin:0;font-size:16px;font-weight:700;line-height:1.25;\n                  text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:.02em;transition:color .15s ease;}\n  .iq-kach__item:hover .iq-kach__label,\n  .iq-kach__item:focus-visible .iq-kach__label{color:#A51D1B;}\n  .iq-kach__usp{margin:4px 0 0;font-size:13px;line-height:1.4;opacity:.62;min-height:2.8em;}\n\n  @media (max-width:749px){\n    .iq-kach__h{margin-bottom:14px;}\n    .iq-kach__grid{grid-template-columns:repeat(2,1fr);gap:8px;}\n    .iq-kach__body{padding:11px 11px 13px;}\n    .iq-kach__label{font-size:14px;}\n    .iq-kach__usp{font-size:12px;min-height:2.8em;}\n  }\n</style>\n\n{%- assign sz = '(max-width: 749px) 45vw, 32vw' -%}\n{%- assign wd = '300, 500, 800' -%}\n\n<div class=\"page-width\">\n\n{%- if request.locale.iso_code == 'en' -%}\n\n  <h2 class=\"rich-text__heading h2 iq-kach__h\">What do you need for training?</h2>\n\n  <div class=\"iq-kach__grid\">\n\n    <a class=\"iq-kach__item\" href=\"{{ routes.collections_url }}/hundesport-westen\">\n      <div class=\"iq-kach__frame\">{%- if images['kachel-westen.jpg'] != blank -%}{{ images['kachel-westen.jpg'] | image_url: width: 1000 | image_tag: widths: wd, sizes: sz, loading: 'eager', class: 'iq-kach__img', alt: 'Handler in an IQ dog sport vest, ball dropping from the chest pocket' }}{%- endif -%}</div>\n      <div class=\"iq-kach__body\">\n        <p class=\"iq-kach__label\">Vests</p>\n      <p class=\"iq-kach__usp\">Patented features for precise training.</p>\n      </div>\n    </a>\n\n    <a class=\"iq-kach__item\" href=\"{{ routes.collections_url }}/hundesport-jacken\">\n      <div class=\"iq-kach__frame\">{%- if images['kachel-jacken-ohne-orange.jpg'] != blank -%}{{ images['kachel-jacken-ohne-orange.jpg'] | image_url: width: 1000 | image_tag: widths: wd, sizes: sz, loading: 'eager', class: 'iq-kach__img', alt: 'Handler in an IQ jacket training with a Malinois in wet weather' }}{%- endif -%}</div>\n      <div class=\"iq-kach__body\">\n        <p class=\"iq-kach__label\">Jackets</p>\n      <p class=\"iq-kach__usp\">Train in any weather. Up to 20,000 mm water column.</p>\n      </div>\n    </a>\n\n    <a class=\"iq-kach__item\" href=\"{{ routes.collections_url }}/hundesport-t-shirts-hoodies\">\n      <div class=\"iq-kach__frame\">{%- if images['kachel-hoodies.jpg'] != blank -%}{{ images['kachel-hoodies.jpg'] | image_url: width: 1000 | image_tag: widths: wd, sizes: sz, loading: 'eager', class: 'iq-kach__img', alt: 'Back view of an IQ training hoodie with print, dog heeling in the snow' }}{%- endif -%}</div>\n      <div class=\"iq-kach__body\">\n        <p class=\"iq-kach__label\">Shirts &amp; Hoodies</p>\n      <p class=\"iq-kach__usp\">Function and storage for your training.</p>\n      </div>\n    </a>\n\n    <a class=\"iq-kach__item\" href=\"{{ routes.collections_url }}/hundesport-trainingszubehoer\">\n      <div class=\"iq-kach__frame\">{%- if images['kachel-geschirre.jpg'] != blank -%}{{ images['kachel-geschirre.jpg'] | image_url: width: 1000 | image_tag: widths: wd, sizes: sz, loading: 'lazy', class: 'iq-kach__img', alt: 'Malinois in an IQ Performance Pro harness during leash work' }}{%- endif -%}</div>\n      <div class=\"iq-kach__body\">\n        <p class=\"iq-kach__label\">Training &amp; Dog</p>\n      <p class=\"iq-kach__usp\">Everything for precise, effective dog training.</p>\n      </div>\n    </a>\n\n    <a class=\"iq-kach__item\" href=\"{{ routes.collections_url }}/trainingsfutter-supplemente\">\n      <div class=\"iq-kach__frame\">{%- if images['kachel-futter.jpg'] != blank -%}{{ images['kachel-futter.jpg'] | image_url: width: 1000 | image_tag: widths: wd, sizes: sz, loading: 'lazy', class: 'iq-kach__img', alt: 'Young German Shepherd carrying a bag of IQ Pure Bites training treats' }}{%- endif -%}</div>\n      <div class=\"iq-kach__body\">\n        <p class=\"iq-kach__label\">Treats</p>\n      <p class=\"iq-kach__usp\">Training food for fast, precise rewards.</p>\n      </div>\n    </a>\n\n    <a class=\"iq-kach__item\" href=\"{{ routes.collections_url }}/dog-training-toys\">\n      <div class=\"iq-kach__frame\">{%- if images['kachel-spielzeug.jpg'] != blank -%}{{ images['kachel-spielzeug.jpg'] | image_url: width: 1000 | image_tag: widths: wd, sizes: sz, loading: 'lazy', class: 'iq-kach__img', alt: 'Malinois with a full grip on an IQ tug during training' }}{%- endif -%}</div>\n      <div class=\"iq-kach__body\">\n        <p class=\"iq-kach__label\">Toys</p>\n      <p class=\"iq-kach__usp\">For strong dogs. Built for real training.</p>\n      </div>\n    </a>\n\n  </div>\n\n{%- else -%}\n\n  <h2 class=\"rich-text__heading h2 iq-kach__h\">Was brauchst Du f&uuml;rs Training?</h2>\n\n  <div class=\"iq-kach__grid\">\n\n    <a class=\"iq-kach__item\" href=\"{{ routes.collections_url }}/hundesport-westen\">\n      <div class=\"iq-kach__frame\">{%- if images['kachel-westen.jpg'] != blank -%}{{ images['kachel-westen.jpg'] | image_url: width: 1000 | image_tag: widths: wd, sizes: sz, loading: 'eager', class: 'iq-kach__img', alt: 'Hundeführer in IQ Hundesportweste, Ball fällt aus der patentierten Brusttasche' }}{%- endif -%}</div>\n      <div class=\"iq-kach__body\">\n        <p class=\"iq-kach__label\">Westen</p>\n      <p class=\"iq-kach__usp\">Patentierte Features f&uuml;r pr&auml;zises Training.</p>\n      </div>\n    </a>\n\n    <a class=\"iq-kach__item\" href=\"{{ routes.collections_url }}/hundesport-jacken\">\n      <div class=\"iq-kach__frame\">{%- if images['kachel-jacken-ohne-orange.jpg'] != blank -%}{{ images['kachel-jacken-ohne-orange.jpg'] | image_url: width: 1000 | image_tag: widths: wd, sizes: sz, loading: 'eager', class: 'iq-kach__img', alt: 'Hundeführerin in IQ Multifunktionsjacke beim Training mit Malinois bei Regen' }}{%- endif -%}</div>\n      <div class=\"iq-kach__body\">\n        <p class=\"iq-kach__label\">Jacken</p>\n      <p class=\"iq-kach__usp\">Wetterfest trainieren. Bis 20.000 mm Wassers&auml;ule.</p>\n      </div>\n    </a>\n\n    <a class=\"iq-kach__item\" href=\"{{ routes.collections_url }}/hundesport-t-shirts-hoodies\">\n      <div class=\"iq-kach__frame\">{%- if images['kachel-hoodies.jpg'] != blank -%}{{ images['kachel-hoodies.jpg'] | image_url: width: 1000 | image_tag: widths: wd, sizes: sz, loading: 'eager', class: 'iq-kach__img', alt: 'Rückenansicht IQ Trainingshoodie mit Print, Hund im Fuß im Schnee' }}{%- endif -%}</div>\n      <div class=\"iq-kach__body\">\n        <p class=\"iq-kach__label\">Shirts &amp; Hoodies</p>\n      <p class=\"iq-kach__usp\">Funktion und Stauraum f&uuml;r dein Training.</p>\n      </div>\n    </a>\n\n    <a class=\"iq-kach__item\" href=\"{{ routes.collections_url }}/hundesport-trainingszubehoer\">\n      <div class=\"iq-kach__frame\">{%- if images['kachel-geschirre.jpg'] != blank -%}{{ images['kachel-geschirre.jpg'] | image_url: width: 1000 | image_tag: widths: wd, sizes: sz, loading: 'lazy', class: 'iq-kach__img', alt: 'Malinois im IQ Performance Pro Geschirr beim Verbellen in der Leinenarbeit' }}{%- endif -%}</div>\n      <div class=\"iq-kach__body\">\n        <p class=\"iq-kach__label\">Training &amp; Hund</p>\n      <p class=\"iq-kach__usp\">Alles f&uuml;r pr&auml;zises, effektives Hundetraining.</p>\n      </div>\n    </a>\n\n    <a class=\"iq-kach__item\" href=\"{{ routes.collections_url }}/trainingsfutter-supplemente\">\n      <div class=\"iq-kach__frame\">{%- if images['kachel-futter.jpg'] != blank -%}{{ images['kachel-futter.jpg'] | image_url: width: 1000 | image_tag: widths: wd, sizes: sz, loading: 'lazy', class: 'iq-kach__img', alt: 'Junger Schäferhund trägt eine Packung IQ Pure Bites Trainingshappen' }}{%- endif -%}</div>\n      <div class=\"iq-kach__body\">\n        <p class=\"iq-kach__label\">Futter</p>\n      <p class=\"iq-kach__usp\">Trainingsfutter f&uuml;r schnelle, pr&auml;zise Best&auml;tigung.</p>\n      </div>\n    </a>\n\n    <a class=\"iq-kach__item\" href=\"{{ routes.collections_url }}/hundesport-spielzeug\">\n      <div class=\"iq-kach__frame\">{%- if images['kachel-spielzeug.jpg'] != blank -%}{{ images['kachel-spielzeug.jpg'] | image_url: width: 1000 | image_tag: widths: wd, sizes: sz, loading: 'lazy', class: 'iq-kach__img', alt: 'Malinois im vollen Griff am IQ Beißwurst beim Training' }}{%- endif -%}</div>\n      <div class=\"iq-kach__body\">\n        <p class=\"iq-kach__label\">Spielzeug</p>\n      <p class=\"iq-kach__usp\">F&uuml;r starke Hunde. F&uuml;r echtes Training gemacht.</p>\n      </div>\n    </a>\n\n  </div>\n\n{%- endif -%}\n\n</div>",
