    "custom_liquid_Rjn4t7": {
      "type": "custom-liquid",
      "disabled": true,
      "name": "Snacks",
      "settings": {
        "custom_liquid": "{%- comment -%}\n==================================================================\nIQ Startseite - Block \"Snacks / Runterkommen\"   ·  18.09.2026\nEigener Abschnitt, separat vom Jacken-Block.\nEinsetzen: Theme-Editor -> Startseite -> \"Benutzerdefiniertes Liquid\",\nFarbschema des Abschnitts auf 2 (hell) stellen, Feld leeren, alles einsetzen.\nClaude kann Theme-Dateien NICHT schreiben -> Einbau macht Hamza/Patricia.\n\nSTATUS: einsetzbereit. Nichts auszufüllen.\n- Bild: IQ-Sticks-Pferd-1000g-web.jpg liegt in Shopify Files (per file_url gezogen).\n- Button: DE /collections/trainingsfutter-supplemente, EN /en/collections/trainingsfutter-supplemente.\nStil wie Jacken-Block: Hero/H2 Montserrat Italic 800 (.hd), sonst Archivo;\nFarben ueber das Color-Scheme (kein hart codierter Button, Rot ueber Theme-Variable).\n==================================================================\n{%- endcomment -%}\n\n{%- assign en = false -%}\n{%- if request.locale.iso_code == 'en' -%}{%- assign en = true -%}{%- endif -%}\n\n<style>\n.iqsnack{background:rgb(var(--color-background));color:rgb(var(--color-foreground));font-family:Archivo,Arial,sans-serif}\n.iqsnack .w{max-width:1180px;margin:0 auto;padding:48px 24px}\n.iqsnack .grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1.1fr;gap:44px;align-items:center}\n.iqsnack .ph{aspect-ratio:1/1;background:#fff;border:1px solid #DCDBD7;border-radius:30px;overflow:hidden}\n.iqsnack .ph img{width:100%;height:100%;object-fit:contain;display:block}\n.iqsnack .kick{font-size:12px;letter-spacing:3px;text-transform:uppercase;color:#A51D1B;font-weight:700}\n.iqsnack .hd{font-family:Montserrat,Arial,sans-serif;font-style:italic;font-weight:800;text-transform:uppercase;line-height:1.02;font-size:clamp(28px,4vw,44px);margin:10px 0 0}\n.iqsnack .hd .red{color:#A51D1B;display:block}\n.iqsnack .lead{font-size:17px;font-weight:700;margin:16px 0 0}\n.iqsnack ul{list-style:none;margin:16px 0 0;padding:0;max-width:520px}\n.iqsnack li{position:relative;padding-left:22px;margin:10px 0;font-size:15px;color:rgba(var(--color-foreground),.85)}\n.iqsnack li::before{content:\"\";position:absolute;left:3px;top:6px;width:7px;height:7px;border:solid #A51D1B;border-width:2.5px 2.5px 0 0;transform:rotate(45deg)}\n.iqsnack .cta{margin-top:24px}\n.iqsnack .btn--red{--color-button:165,29,27;--color-button-label:245,244,242}\n@media(max-width:820px){\n  .iqsnack .grid{grid-template-columns:1fr;gap:22px}\n  .iqsnack .w{padding:36px 20px}\n}\n</style>\n\n<section class=\"iqsnack color-scheme-2\"><div class=\"w\">\n  <div class=\"grid\">\n\n    <div class=\"ph\">\n      {%- assign foto_snack = 'IQ-Sticks-Pferd-1000g-web.jpg' -%}\n      <img src=\"{{ foto_snack | file_url }}&width=760\" width=\"760\" height=\"760\" loading=\"lazy\"\n           alt=\"{% if en %}IQ Sticks Horse, grain-free meat treat in a pouch{% else %}IQ Sticks Pferd, getreidefreier Fleischsnack im Beutel{% endif %}\">\n    </div>\n\n    <div>\n      <div class=\"kick\">{% if en %}For our dogs' everyday life{% else %}Für den Alltag unserer Hunde{% endif %}</div>\n      <h2 class=\"hd\">\n        {% if en %}Give it all outside.<span class=\"red\">Then wind down.</span>\n        {% else %}Draußen alles geben.<span class=\"red\">Danach runterkommen.</span>{% endif %}\n      </h2>\n      <p class=\"lead\">{% if en %}Work together. Then wind down.{% else %}Gemeinsam arbeiten. Danach zur Ruhe kommen.{% endif %}</p>\n      <ul>\n        <li>{% if en %}Training treats for tracking and marking, in several varieties (horse, duck), made in Germany{% else %}Trainingssnacks für Fährte und Bestätigung, verschiedene Sorten (Pferd, Ente), hergestellt in Deutschland{% endif %}</li>\n        <li>{% if en %}Single-protein Horse: one meat source, a favourite for allergy-prone and sensitive dogs{% else %}Monoprotein Pferd: nur eine Fleischquelle, beliebt bei Allergikern und sensiblen Hunden{% endif %}</li>\n        <li>{% if en %}Beef and horse scalp for extended chewing{% else %}Rinder- und Pferdekopfhaut zum ausgiebigen Kauen{% endif %}</li>\n      </ul>\n      <div class=\"cta\">\n        {%- if en -%}\n          <a class=\"btn btn--primary btn--red\" href=\"/en/collections/trainingsfutter-supplemente\">Discover the treats</a>\n        {%- else -%}\n          <a class=\"btn btn--primary btn--red\" href=\"/collections/trainingsfutter-supplemente\">Snacks entdecken</a>\n        {%- endif -%}\n      </div>\n    </div>\n\n  </div>\n</div></section>",
        "color_scheme": "scheme-2",
        "padding_top": 50,
        "padding_bottom": 50,
        "custom_class": ""
      }
    },
    "custom_liquid_6R8jQD": {
      "type": "custom-liquid",
      "name": "IQ klassiker",
      "settings": {
        "custom_liquid": "<style>\n  .iqk{\n    width:100vw; margin-left:calc(50% - 50vw);\n    background:#fff; color:#171717;\n    font-family:Archivo,Arial,sans-serif;\n    --iqk-scale:1.12; /* Produkt-Vergroesserung; bei Anschnitt kleiner stellen */\n  }\n  .iqk__head{ max-width:1360px; margin:0 auto; padding:34px 20px 0; box-sizing:border-box; }\n  .iqk__eyebrow{ margin:0; font-size:11px; font-weight:700; letter-spacing:3px; text-transform:uppercase; color:rgba(23,23,23,.55); }\n  .iqk__title{ margin:10px 0 0; font-family:Montserrat,Arial,sans-serif; font-style:italic; font-weight:800; text-transform:uppercase; font-size:clamp(32px,8vw,44px); line-height:1.0; letter-spacing:-.5px; }\n\n  /* MOBILE: horizontaler Swipe, grosse Slides */\n  .iqk__track{\n    display:grid; grid-auto-flow:column; grid-auto-columns:88vw; gap:14px;\n    overflow-x:auto; scroll-snap-type:x mandatory; scroll-padding-inline:20px;\n    padding:22px 20px 0; box-sizing:border-box;\n    -webkit-overflow-scrolling:touch; overscroll-behavior-inline:contain; scrollbar-width:none;\n  }\n  .iqk__track::-webkit-scrollbar{ display:none; }\n\n  .iqk__item{ scroll-snap-align:start; display:flex; flex-direction:column; min-width:0; }\n\n  .iqk__media{\n    position:relative; width:100%; aspect-ratio:4/5; overflow:hidden; background:#fff;\n    display:block; text-decoration:none;\n  }\n  .iqk__img, .iqk__img--2{\n    position:absolute; inset:0; width:100%; height:100%;\n    object-fit:contain; transform:scale(var(--iqk-scale)); transition:opacity .3s ease;\n  }\n  .iqk__img--2{ opacity:0; }\n  @media(hover:hover){ .iqk__item:hover .iqk__img--2{ opacity:1; } }\n\n  .iqk__name{\n    display:block; margin:16px 0 0; text-decoration:none; color:#171717;\n    font-family:Montserrat,Arial,sans-serif; font-weight:700; font-size:19px; line-height:1.15;\n  }\n  .iqk__meta{\n    display:flex; align-items:center; justify-content:space-between; gap:12px; margin-top:8px;\n  }\n  .iqk__rating{ min-width:0; }\n  .iqk__price{ font-weight:700; font-size:15px; white-space:nowrap; }\n  .iqk__price s{ opacity:.5; font-weight:400; margin-left:6px; }\n  .iqk__price .iqk__sale{ color:#A51D1B; }\n  /* Judge.me-Badge kompakt einbetten */\n  .iqk__rating .jdgm-prev-badge__stars{ vertical-align:middle; }\n  .iqk__rating .jdgm-prev-badge__text{ font-size:12px; }\n\n  .iqk__cta{ max-width:1360px; margin:0 auto; padding:30px 20px 4px; box-sizing:border-box; }\n  .iqk__pill{\n    display:inline-flex; align-items:center; height:46px; padding:0 24px;\n    border:1.5px solid #171717; border-radius:var(--buttons-radius,2px); background:transparent; color:#171717;\n    font-weight:700; font-size:13px; letter-spacing:.5px; text-transform:uppercase; text-decoration:none;\n    transition:background-color .2s ease,border-color .2s ease,color .2s ease;\n  }\n  .iqk__pill:hover{ background:#A51D1B; border-color:#A51D1B; color:#F5F4F2; }\n  .iqk__pill:focus-visible{ outline:3px solid #A51D1B; outline-offset:3px; }\n\n  /* TABLET */\n  @media(min-width:750px){\n    .iqk__head{ padding:40px 32px 0; }\n    .iqk__track{\n      grid-auto-flow:row; grid-template-columns:repeat(2,minmax(0,1fr)); grid-auto-columns:auto;\n      gap:32px; overflow:visible; scroll-snap-type:none;\n      max-width:1360px; margin:0 auto; padding:28px 32px 0;\n    }\n    .iqk__cta{ padding:32px 32px 8px; }\n  }\n  /* DESKTOP: 3 pro Reihe, gross */\n  @media(min-width:990px){\n    .iqk__track{ grid-template-columns:repeat(3,minmax(0,1fr)); gap:40px; }\n    .iqk__name{ font-size:20px; }\n  }\n  @media(prefers-reduced-motion:reduce){\n    .iqk__img,.iqk__img--2{ transition:none; }\n  }\n</style>\n\n<section class=\"iqk\">\n  <div class=\"iqk__head\">\n    <p class=\"iqk__eyebrow\">{{ 'iq_translation.home.classics_eyebrow' | t }}</p>\n    <h2 class=\"iqk__title\">{{ 'iq_translation.home.classics_heading' | t }}</h2>\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"iqk__track\">\n    {%- for product in collections['bestseller'].products limit: 6 -%}\n      {%- assign v = product.selected_or_first_available_variant -%}\n      <div class=\"iqk__item\">\n        <a class=\"iqk__media\" href=\"{{ product.url }}\" aria-label=\"{{ product.title | escape }}\">\n          {%- if product.featured_media -%}\n            <img class=\"iqk__img\"\n                 src=\"{{ product.featured_media | image_url: width: 900 }}\"\n                 srcset=\"{{ product.featured_media | image_url: width: 400 }} 400w, {{ product.featured_media | image_url: width: 600 }} 600w, {{ product.featured_media | image_url: width: 900 }} 900w\"\n                 sizes=\"(min-width:990px) 30vw, (min-width:750px) 45vw, 88vw\"\n                 width=\"900\" height=\"1125\" loading=\"lazy\"\n                 alt=\"{{ product.featured_media.alt | escape | default: product.title | escape }}\">\n          {%- endif -%}\n          {%- if product.images[1] != blank -%}\n            <img class=\"iqk__img iqk__img--2\"\n                 src=\"{{ product.images[1] | image_url: width: 900 }}\"\n                 width=\"900\" height=\"1125\" loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\n          {%- endif -%}\n        </a>\n\n        <a class=\"iqk__name\" href=\"{{ product.url }}\">{{ product.title }}</a>\n\n        <div class=\"iqk__meta\">\n          <span class=\"iqk__rating\">\n            <div class=\"jdgm-widget jdgm-preview-badge\">{{ product.metafields.judgeme.badge }}</div>\n          </span>\n          <span class=\"iqk__price\">\n            {%- if v.compare_at_price > v.price -%}\n              <span class=\"iqk__sale\">{{ v.price | money }}</span> <s>{{ v.compare_at_price | money }}</s>\n            {%- else -%}\n              {{ v.price | money }}\n            {%- endif -%}\n          </span>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    {%- endfor -%}\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"iqk__cta\">\n    <a class=\"iqk__pill\" href=\"{{ collections['bestseller'].url }}\">{{ 'iq_translation.home.all_bestsellers' | t }} &rarr;</a>\n  </div>\n</section>",
        "color_scheme": "scheme-1",
        "padding_top": 32,
        "padding_bottom": 50,
        "custom_class": ""
      }
    },
    "custom_liquid_9xdJJe": {
      "type": "custom-liquid",
      "name": "Gründer",
      "settings": {
        "custom_liquid": "{%- assign en = false -%}\n{%- if request.locale.iso_code == 'en' -%}\n  {%- assign en = true -%}\n{%- endif -%}\n\n{%- assign gruenderfoto = 'About-us-Patricia-und-Florian-Knabl-FMBB.jpg' -%}\n\n<style>\n  .iqfounder {\n    background: rgb(var(--color-background));\n    color: rgb(var(--color-foreground));\n    font-family: Archivo, Arial, sans-serif;\n    border: 0;\n    border-radius: 0 !important;\n    box-shadow: none !important;\n  }\n\n  .iqfounder__inner { width: 100%; }\n\n  /* IMAGE – MOBILE */\n  .iqfounder__media {\n    position: relative;\n    width: 100%;\n    aspect-ratio: 4 / 5;\n    overflow: hidden;\n    background: #111;\n    border: 0;\n    border-radius: 0 !important;\n    box-shadow: none !important;\n  }\n  .iqfounder__media img {\n    position: absolute;\n    inset: 0;\n    display: block;\n    width: 100%;\n    height: 100%;\n    object-fit: cover;\n    object-position: 50% 50%;\n    border-radius: 0 !important;\n  }\n\n  /* CONTENT – MOBILE */\n  .iqfounder__content { padding: 28px 20px 64px; box-sizing: border-box; }\n  .iqfounder__eyebrow {\n    margin: 0;\n    font-family: Archivo, Arial, sans-serif;\n    font-size: 11px; line-height: 1.2; font-weight: 700;\n    letter-spacing: 2.8px; text-transform: uppercase;\n    color: rgba(var(--color-foreground), .58);\n  }\n  .iqfounder__quote {\n    margin: 10px 0 0; max-width: 720px;\n    font-family: Montserrat, Arial, sans-serif; font-style: italic; font-weight: 800;\n    font-size: clamp(29px, 8vw, 38px); line-height: 1.04; letter-spacing: -.35px;\n    text-transform: uppercase; color: rgb(var(--color-foreground));\n  }\n  .iqfounder__body {\n    margin: 20px 0 0; max-width: 620px;\n    font-family: Archivo, Arial, sans-serif;\n    font-size: 15.5px; line-height: 1.55; font-weight: 400;\n    color: rgba(var(--color-foreground), .76);\n  }\n  .iqfounder__cta { margin-top: 24px; }\n  .iqfounder__pill {\n    min-height: 46px; padding: 0 24px;\n    display: inline-flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; gap: 8px;\n    border: 1.5px solid rgb(var(--color-foreground)); border-radius:var(--buttons-radius,2px);\n    background: transparent; color: rgb(var(--color-foreground));\n    font-family: Archivo, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1; font-weight: 700;\n    letter-spacing: .4px; text-transform: uppercase; text-decoration: none;\n    transition: background-color .2s ease, border-color .2s ease, color .2s ease;\n  }\n  .iqfounder__arrow { display: inline-block; transition: transform .2s ease; }\n  .iqfounder__pill:hover { background: #A51D1B; border-color: #A51D1B; color: #F5F4F2; }\n  .iqfounder__pill:hover .iqfounder__arrow { transform: translateX(3px); }\n  .iqfounder__pill:focus-visible { outline: 3px solid #A51D1B; outline-offset: 3px; }\n\n  /* TABLET */\n  @media (min-width: 750px) and (max-width: 989px) {\n    .iqfounder__inner { padding: 0 24px; box-sizing: border-box; }\n    .iqfounder__media { aspect-ratio: 16 / 11; }\n    .iqfounder__content { padding: 34px 0 72px; }\n    .iqfounder__quote { max-width: 720px; font-size: 42px; }\n    .iqfounder__body { max-width: 680px; font-size: 16px; }\n  }\n\n  /* DESKTOP – editorial split ~60/40 */\n  @media (min-width: 990px) {\n    .iqfounder { padding: 72px 0; }\n    .iqfounder__inner {\n      max-width: 1360px; margin-inline: auto; padding-inline: 32px; box-sizing: border-box;\n      display: grid; grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1.45fr) minmax(360px, 1fr);\n      gap: clamp(52px, 5vw, 80px); align-items: center;\n    }\n    .iqfounder__media { aspect-ratio: 4 / 5; min-height: 650px; }\n    .iqfounder__media img { object-position: 50% 50%; }\n    .iqfounder__content { padding: 0; }\n    .iqfounder__eyebrow { font-size: 12px; }\n    .iqfounder__quote { margin-top: 14px; font-size: clamp(36px, 3.4vw, 52px); line-height: 1.03; letter-spacing: -.6px; }\n    .iqfounder__body { margin-top: 26px; max-width: 500px; font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.6; }\n    .iqfounder__cta { margin-top: 28px; }\n  }\n\n  @media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce) {\n    .iqfounder__pill, .iqfounder__arrow { transition: none; }\n    .iqfounder__pill:hover .iqfounder__arrow { transform: none; }\n  }\n</style>\n\n<section class=\"iqfounder color-scheme-2\">\n  <div class=\"iqfounder__inner\">\n\n    <div class=\"iqfounder__media\">\n      <img\n        src=\"{{ gruenderfoto | file_url }}&width=1600\"\n        width=\"1600\" height=\"2000\" loading=\"lazy\"\n        alt=\"{% if en %}IQ Dogsport founders Patricia and Florian Knabl with their dog{% else %}IQ Dogsport Gründer Patricia und Florian Knabl mit ihrem Hund{% endif %}\"\n      >\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"iqfounder__content\">\n      <p class=\"iqfounder__eyebrow\">{% if en %}The founders{% else %}Die Gründer{% endif %}</p>\n\n      <blockquote class=\"iqfounder__quote\">\n        {% if en %}We only develop what we miss in our own training.\n        {% else %}\"Wir entwickeln nur, was wir selbst im Training vermissen.\"{% endif %}\n      </blockquote>\n\n      <div class=\"iqfounder__body\">\n        {% if en %}\"Every product comes from our own practice: in training, in competition, on duty.\"\n        {% else %}Jedes Produkt entsteht aus eigener Praxis: im Training, im Wettkampf, im Dienst.{% endif %}\n      </div>\n\n      <div class=\"iqfounder__cta\">\n        {%- if en -%}\n          <a class=\"iqfounder__pill\" href=\"/en/pages/uber-iq-dogsport\">\n            Our story <span class=\"iqfounder__arrow\" aria-hidden=\"true\">&rarr;</span>\n          </a>\n        {%- else -%}\n          <a class=\"iqfounder__pill\" href=\"/pages/uber-iq-dogsport\">\n            Unsere Geschichte <span class=\"iqfounder__arrow\" aria-hidden=\"true\">&rarr;</span>\n          </a>\n        {%- endif -%}\n      </div>\n    </div>\n\n  </div>\n</section>",
        "color_scheme": "scheme-2",
        "padding_top": 0,
        "padding_bottom": 0,
        "custom_class": ""
      }
